{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"54821","name":"Dei Congressi","description":"Elegance, attention to detail and a warm atmosphere are the leitmotiv of this elegant property. This comfortable hotel is located right in front of the congress centre ‘La Nuvola’ and just a 5-minute walking distance from the Palazzo dei Congressi. The B-line subway stop EUR Fermi is also close to the property, providing easy access to all this vibrant city has to offer. As for the local airports, Ciampino and Fiumicino Airport are both about a 25 minute-driving distance away. This contemporary property features a large choice of elegantly appointed rooms which have been decorated with soothing tones and wooden furniture. Those travelling with the children or friends are sure to appreciate the quadruple rooms, as they provide more space. The facilities include a restaurant serving an à la carte menu as well as a lunch buffet, as well as the ‘Congressi’ ballroom which can accommodate up to 200 people.","address":"Viale Shakespeare, 29","city":"ROME","countryCode":"IT","postalCode":"00144","lat":41.830386,"lng":12.473327,"stars":4,"giataCode":"73226","phone":"39065911923","email":"info@hoteldeicongressiroma.com","website":"www.hoteldeicongressiroma.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/05/054821/054821a_hb_a_018.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/05/054821/054821a_hb_a_021.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/05/054821/054821a_hb_a_022_20250627_090911.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/05/054821/054821a_hb_a_023_20250627_090919.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/05/054821/054821a_hb_a_024_20250627_090927.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/05/054821/054821a_hb_a_025_20250627_090936.jpg","category":